{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33139","headline":"感情 · 于武陵","name":"感情","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"青山长寂寞，南望独高歌。\n四海故人尽，九原新壠多。\n西沈浮世日，东注逝川波。\n不使年华驻，此生能几何。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"于武陵","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33139.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33139","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、古籍注评：《才调集》（中文维基文库，CC BY-SA 4.0，https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/才調集_(四庫全書本)）"}